# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — build context filter for the cti-app image.
# Rules:
#   * Always exclude secrets, local state and VCS metadata from the context.
#   * frontend/ IS the build source (Dockerfile Stage 1 runs npm ci + vite
#     build there) — keep it in the context. The image's own .dockerignore
#     conventions (node_modules, dist) still apply; only the source tree is
#     needed, and node_modules/dist are produced inside the build.
#   * The baked SPA output (web/dist) is produced inside the image and must
#     never come from the host.
# =============================================================================
.env
**/.env
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/chdata/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
node_modules/
.git/
*.md
adr/